Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 11:15:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: stm32: introduce ARIES Embedded module MSMP2 on EVK

Signed-off-by: Wolfgang Grandegger <wg@aries-embedded.de>
---
